 "remarks": "336 Westport Ave, Norwalk, CT 06851  Prime Retail / Drive-Thru Opportunity - For Lease  Highly visible stand-alone commercial building available for lease on Westport Avenue (US Route 1), one of Norwalk's established high-traffic retail corridors. This approximately 1,320 SF property offers an excellent opportunity for a retailer, cafe, food-service operator, convenience business, or other approved commercial use.  The property features a drive-thru window, open retail layout, concrete flooring, central air conditioning, natural-gas heat, one restroom, and approximately 12 on-site parking spaces. Situated on approximately 0.23 acres with direct frontage on a major state road, the location provides excellent visibility, accessibility, and convenient customer parking.  Property Highlights:  Approximately 1,320 SF stand-alone building Drive-thru window Approximately 12 parking spaces High-traffic Westport Avenue / US-1 location Excellent street visibility B2 zoning Central air Natural-gas heat Public water and sewer Ideal for retail, food service, cafe, convenience, or other approved uses    An exceptional opportunity for an operator seeking a highly visible, easily accessible location in Norwalk.  Tenant and tenant's agent to verify permitted uses, zoning, dimensions, parking, and all other property information with the appropriate authorities.",
